{{~##
   What every generated PHP file starts with: the banner, strict types, the namespace, the
   requires and the imports.

   PHP has no autoloader here, so a split file has to require what it uses - and how deep it
   sits decides the path. Both are worked out in the generator and arrive as finished lines,
   because path arithmetic in a template is arithmetic nothing can test.
##~}}
